# The hub image is built from the repository root; only what an install runs goes in (it installs and builds that
# itself), plus the fake Claude Code and the entrypoint. Test specs stay out, so editing one keeps the built layers.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/__pycache__
.git
docs
preview
tests/integration/*
!tests/integration/fake-server
!tests/integration/hub
